@host = https://localhost:7056

### Login as a member (Dana)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "dana@gym.local", "password": "Member#123" }

### Capture the token from the login response
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login as a second member (Noa) for the race
# @name login2
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "noa@gym.local", "password": "Member#123" }

@token2 = {{login2.response.body.accessToken}}

### Browse upcoming sessions (paged, only ones with room)
GET {{host}}/api/classsessions?page=1&pageSize=10&onlyAvailable=true&sortBy=startsAt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The seeded near-full Spin session is id 1 (capacity 3, 2 booked).
### Fire the next two requests as close together as possible:
### one returns 201, the other 409 Conflict.
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "classSessionId": 1 }

###
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "classSessionId": 1 }

### My bookings
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Satisfaction ratings for a session (any member) — average + every rating
GET {{host}}/api/classsessions/1/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Leave / update my star rating for a session I attended (1–5 stars)
### 400 if the session has not happened yet, 403 if I had no confirmed booking.
POST {{host}}/api/classsessions/1/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stars": 5, "comment": "Great class!" }

### Admin login
# @name admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@gym.local", "password": "Admin#123" }

@adminToken = {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Admin creates a new session
POST {{host}}/api/classsessions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "classTypeId": 1, "instructorId": 1, "startsAtUtc": "2026-12-01T18:00:00Z", "capacity": 2 }

### Admin views a session's waiting list (queue order). A member gets 403.
GET {{host}}/api/classsessions/1/waitlist
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### A member cannot create a session -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/classsessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "classTypeId": 1, "instructorId": 1, "startsAtUtc": "2026-12-01T18:00:00Z" }
